WEBVTT

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:05.200
If this is what I have to suffer,

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.270
I will never yearn for another person again.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.270
In the winter of my 16th year,

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:16.640
I experienced a painful parting
that cut me to the quick.

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:30.120
Maria Watches Over Us

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:52.930
The White Petals

00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:02.040
So Christmas is coming again.

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:11.490
The first time I met Shiori was on a spring day.

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:16.060
That morning, I had arrived at
school far earlier than normal.

00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:21.040
A second year student in high school,

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:23.200
I was sick and tired of absolutely everything.

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:26.670
Of this Academy that was
like a pasture for angels.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:29.640
And of the students who smiled so innocently.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:33.510
This world was surely a righteous place.

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:35.240
In which case,

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:38.380
I am a wicked lamb,
who is incapable of conforming to it.

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:41.520
Save me, such as I am.

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:44.950
Amen. Amen. Amen.

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:48.790
Why must I laugh along with everyone else?

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:52.730
Why must I listen to stories
that don't interest me?

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.440
That was why I lapsed into silence.

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:57.470
I didn't know what I should do,

00:02:57.470 --> 00:02:59.530
nor even what I wanted to do.

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:02.240
No one touch me.

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:04.710
Just forget about me!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:11.240
There is not an ounce of warmth within me.

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:16.150
In the vast, barren wilderness,
I am utterly lost and alone.

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:32.660
She was so mature...

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:36.270
...and she seemed full of the warmth that I lacked.

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:43.780
Kubo Shiori?

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:44.950
What?

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:49.260
It's the first time I've heard
you utter a person's name.

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:50.590
It's nothing.

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:54.760
I just met a first year student by
that name this morning, that's all.

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:58.690
Something had begun to change within me.

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:00.730
If you don't know her, that's fine.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:01.760
Wait.

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:05.970
Sei, you have far too little awareness
of your position as a bouton.

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:10.470
Oh? We have a rare visitor.

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:12.500
Onee-sama...

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:15.850
Sachiko-chan is so pretty, like a Japanese doll,

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:17.510
I can't help but want to coddle her.

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:19.980
Pardon me for my outlandish looks.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:22.080
Oh, are you pouting?

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:24.780
How silly of you. I like your face, Sei.

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:27.530
After all, I chose you for my little
sister based on your face.

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:29.860
I'm much obliged.

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:32.430
She told me.

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:35.900
To stay by her side, because
she wanted to see my face.

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:38.440
With just that,

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:40.970
I decided that I would be her little sister.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:44.740
Because I found that simple
and clear reason appealing.

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:46.040
That's right.

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:49.950
My Onee-sama was adept at handling me,
right from the start.

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:55.450
I became assertive, to the point
where I even surprised myself.

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:58.560
Is something the matter, Sei-sama?

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:01.390
Is Kubo Shiori-san absent today?

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:03.750
No, she is probably...

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:05.960
...at the chapel.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:11.630
Shiori was there, as if she belonged there.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:16.940
As a white, shining presence,
loved by this world.

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:21.920
Good day, Rosa Gigantea en bouton.

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:25.180
I came to see you.

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:27.750
I wanted to see you.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:31.220
Do you find my feelings bothersome?

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:35.290
I laid myself bare and threw myself on her mercy.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:37.430
There was no turning back.

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:40.570
I've...

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:42.660
...wanted to see you, too.

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:57.450
For the fact that this Academy
had brought Shiori into my life,

00:05:57.450 --> 00:06:00.390
I was moved to thank God
from the bottom of my heart.

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:04.360
We spent as much time alone as we could.

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:09.060
I became even more withdrawn
from the Rose Mansion...

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:10.930
...and I lost myself in Shiori.

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:15.230
Maybe you should maintain
a little more distance.

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:16.940
What are you talking about?

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:19.930
If you want to make her your little
sister, that would be fine, too.

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:23.940
Formally present her your rosary and
introduce her to everyone properly.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:25.780
I'll think about it.

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:27.480
So, may I go?

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:30.550
You may. Make sure you think about it.

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:40.330
I had no intention of making
Shiori my little sister.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.970
In my heart, I scornfully laughed
at the soeur ceremony...

00:06:44.970 --> 00:06:49.560
...as something for people who needed
symbols to reassure themselves.

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:54.110
What's wrong?

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:56.640
It's nothing important.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:02.810
Both of the two hands that we were born with...

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:05.780
...were probably clasped in
the hands of the same person,

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:10.280
and as a result, we completely excluded all else.

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:17.390
Did they say something to you?

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:19.320
I just want to be with you.

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:22.970
That's all I wanted, and yet...

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:37.020
Are you done with your
supplementary swim lesson?

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:37.910
Yes.

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:45.560
Having lost her parents in an accident,

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:47.320
Shiori lived in the student dormitory.

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:51.870
That summer, instead of going home
to her uncle's place in Nagasaki,

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:53.990
she remained at a convent in Tokyo.

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:08.680
I guess we'll have to wait out
the rain here for a while.

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:10.820
It's so warm!

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:28.230
I'm fine, so why don't you dry your own hair?

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:29.470
All right.

00:08:56.860 --> 00:09:03.200
Shiori, why were we born
as separate individuals?

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.750
What are you doing?

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:21.360
Nothing.

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:23.520
You can sleep for a little longer.

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:25.620
I'll wake you up when the rain stops.

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:26.620
Okay.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.290
That tickles.

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:44.540
O rain, don't stop.

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:47.270
If only time would just stop now.

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:50.520
I want to melt together
with Shiori and disappear.

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:53.250
What is this feeling?

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:56.750
To need someone other than myself.

00:09:57.630 --> 00:09:59.960
Where does that ultimately lead?

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:05.300
I will likely never find the
answer to that question.

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:07.430
But that's fine.

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:09.900
The only things that are certain...

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:13.930
...are Shiori's heartbeat,
her physical warmth, and her breath.

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:20.040
And that is all that I desire in this world.

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:25.820
Maria Watches Over Us

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:32.150
Shiori's place in my heart grew ever larger,

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:36.730
and I increasingly spent less
time at the Rose Mansion.

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:41.990
Wait, Sei.

00:10:43.070 --> 00:10:45.730
I'd like to have tea with you for once.

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:55.110
Onee-sama?

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:56.040
What is it?

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:59.320
Why don't you sever your
ties with me as your soeur...

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:01.520
...and find yourself a new little sister?

00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:02.420
No.

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:03.780
But, I...

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:06.190
Please don't break your promise with me.

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:09.960
Stay by my side, where you're
supposed to be, until I graduate.

00:11:10.970 --> 00:11:12.530
You may not have a little sister,

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:14.690
but that can be taken care
of in any number of ways.

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:18.070
Follow the path that you won't regret.

00:11:24.310 --> 00:11:25.400
What do you want?

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:27.740
There's someone waiting for me.

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:29.570
Don't look at me like that.

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:32.340
You make it seem as though
I'm a bringer of bad luck.

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:34.340
Another lecture?

00:11:34.990 --> 00:11:36.680
Be a little bit more objective.

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:39.360
You don't know anything about us.

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:42.690
Then, what do you know of Shiori-san?

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:44.230
What do I know?

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:48.230
I think it'd be better if you
didn't get too involved.

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:50.860
Why are you going to the trouble of saying this?

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:53.700
Because I don't want to see you hurt.

00:11:54.340 --> 00:11:55.710
Me? Hurt?

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:58.710
What will you do when she goes away?

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:01.610
When Shiori... goes away?

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:04.150
She's told you nothing about this?

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:05.910
What do you mean?

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:10.390
Shiori-san is joining a convent
once she graduates.

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:12.920
She's going to become a nun.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:15.150
You're lying.

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:27.230
It's a lie! It's a lie! It's a lie!

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:31.740
It's true.

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:37.040
It was determined since
before I came to this school.

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:39.820
Why did you keep it a secret from me until now?

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:42.820
I just never found the right time to tell you.

00:12:42.890 --> 00:12:44.980
Telling you about it wasn't
going to change anything...

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:53.230
I fell in love with you,

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:55.470
but was that not true for you?

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:56.460
That's not...

00:12:56.870 --> 00:12:59.240
Just a relationship until I graduated!

00:12:59.370 --> 00:13:00.900
Was it that casual for you?!

00:13:01.910 --> 00:13:03.400
I do love you, Sei.

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:06.610
It's the first time I've ever fallen
so in love with someone.

00:13:06.610 --> 00:13:08.910
Then why are you going to become a nun?!

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.480
You're going to choose God over me?!

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:14.010
I have only you, you know.

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:15.780
You're going to abandon me?!

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:18.190
Don't condemn me like that.

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:20.590
It's my wish to become a nun.

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.530
Then why won't you look me in the eyes?!

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:25.070
Isn't it because you're wavering?!

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:25.570
No!

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:26.690
Shiori, I love you!

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:30.130
Don't!

00:13:35.610 --> 00:13:37.580
Maria-sama is watching...

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:39.810
So that's your answer?

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:43.210
I understand.

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:54.980
I had lost to Maria-sama...

00:13:56.960 --> 00:13:59.090
My attitude in class grew worse...

00:13:59.930 --> 00:14:03.560
...and on the day of the closing
ceremonies, I received a summons.

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:06.060
It's not Shiori's fault.

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:10.370
For she and I have nothing to
do with one another anymore.

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:11.600
Sato-san,

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:14.950
that is what Kubo Shiori said as well.

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:16.310
That she was to blame herself.

00:14:17.950 --> 00:14:20.980
Shiori was summoned here, too?

00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:23.920
I would suggest that to lose
yourself in just one thing...

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:27.860
...to the point where you cannot see
what is around you is a lonely thing.

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:34.170
Two days ago, Shiori gave notice that
she would be spending nights away...

00:14:34.170 --> 00:14:37.300
...and she could not be found at
the dormitory or the convent.

00:14:38.470 --> 00:14:41.340
Shiori, how can I see you?

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:43.070
Shiori...

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:47.050
On Christmas...

00:14:47.480 --> 00:14:48.040
What?

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:50.210
We're having a party at the Rose Mansion.

00:14:50.650 --> 00:14:53.140
Rei-chan said she would bake some
delicious cookies and bring them.

00:14:54.090 --> 00:14:55.210
If I feel like it...

00:14:55.820 --> 00:14:57.050
We'll be waiting for you.

00:14:58.430 --> 00:15:00.590
Shiori, I want to see you!

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:01.760
I want to see you!

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:18.580
Shiori!

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:29.380
All the while we were apart,
I thought of nothing else but you!

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:31.030
Even when I was praying,

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:33.320
I couldn't get your face out of my mind!

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:38.060
The Academy Director is very worried about us.

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:40.770
I even promised not to see you again,

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:42.730
but I couldn't do it!

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:50.770
Shiori, let's run away together!

00:15:50.910 --> 00:15:51.540
What?

00:15:51.910 --> 00:15:53.580
Let's go somewhere we don't know,

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:55.510
and live without anyone bothering us.

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:56.770
The two of us?

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:57.710
You don't want to?

00:15:58.290 --> 00:15:59.750
How could I not want to?

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:01.980
If it's with you, I could go anywhere!

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:03.290
But...

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:05.690
We can do it.

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:07.290
Sei...

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:09.120
Pack your things and come.

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:10.390
I'll wait for you at the train station.

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:12.060
All right.

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:13.730
Then, I'll be waiting.

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:15.330
Okay, I'll see you later.

00:16:15.940 --> 00:16:19.030
Shiori saw me off with a smile.

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:22.670
I will not forget that smile.

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:25.240
Never will I forget it.

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:58.170
The appointed time had passed 3 hours ago.

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:08.250
Shiori wasn't coming.

00:17:08.890 --> 00:17:12.760
But I was unable to leave the train terminal,

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:17.830
because Shiori just might come
down those stairs right then,

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:21.770
and I was unable to abandon that faint hope.

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:29.130
Even if it was in a dream...

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:32.310
I wanted to see Shiori...

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:39.690
Onee-sama, why...

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:42.420
I came to get you, in Shiori-san's place.

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:43.720
Where's Shiori?

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:46.930
It seems Shiori-san is not going with you.

00:17:46.930 --> 00:17:47.830
You're lying!

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:54.430
Shiori-san apparently came to this station once.

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:58.340
She watched you here in the
train terminal from afar...

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:01.170
...and she says she realized
she couldn't go, after all.

00:18:01.610 --> 00:18:04.170
If she came, then why didn't
she tell me in person?

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:06.880
Probably because if she saw you,
her resolve would weaken.

00:18:07.010 --> 00:18:07.670
Weaken?

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:11.980
She may seem mature, but she's still
only a first-year high school student.

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:13.680
Of course she would waver.

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:16.890
Let's go home.

00:18:18.090 --> 00:18:19.720
Is Shiori going somewhere?

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:23.350
Yes, she's apparently transferring far away.

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:25.500
Because of me...

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:27.800
It's an outcome that she's satisfied with.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:29.330
But...

00:18:30.300 --> 00:18:31.030
But...

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:33.570
If only she had never met me...

00:18:33.770 --> 00:18:35.440
It was good that you met.

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:38.550
As long as you make your future
one where you can be glad you met,

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:39.380
it's fine.

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:41.940
I'm sure a future like that will never come!

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:44.020
In time, all wounds heal.

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:46.720
And besides, you have me, remember?

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:53.320
I hope you don't seriously think
that I only love your face, do you?

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:54.820
You don't?

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:56.460
How insulting.

00:18:56.730 --> 00:18:59.490
That was just an expedient lie,
so I wouldn't be a burden on you.

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:02.300
I'm good at handling you, you know.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:06.470
But... But you will be graduating!

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:10.670
I'm not the only one concerned about you.

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:12.010
Look.

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:18.720
I'm sorry for worrying you.

00:19:19.020 --> 00:19:19.990
No kidding.

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:24.960
These are Rei-chan's cookies.

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:29.920
It's so warm...

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:33.400
Let's go.

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:34.630
Where?

00:19:34.840 --> 00:19:36.030
My house.

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:39.860
I called your mother earlier to let her
know you would be sleeping over.

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:40.500
What?

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:42.040
No ifs, ands, or buts.

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:44.610
Starting tomorrow, it's our happy winter break.

00:19:44.850 --> 00:19:47.340
So let's stay up late tonight and
have a rousing little party.

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:56.520
The date has changed.

00:19:58.390 --> 00:19:59.830
Happy birthday!
Happy birthday!

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:07.830
With the end of Christmas Eve,
I realized that I had turned 17.

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:19.670
Farewell, Shiori.

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:31.120
Rosa Gigantea.

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:34.030
Yumi-chan.

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:35.820
Is everything ready?

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:38.160
Please help us out too, Rosa Gigantea.

00:20:38.430 --> 00:20:38.860
Oh...

00:20:40.370 --> 00:20:41.030
Who's that?

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:44.500
Kasuga Seiko-san... Um, it's Suga Sei-san.

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:47.730
I met her when we went to
Cosmos' editorial department.

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:48.840
Oh, my!

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:51.340
I apologize for imposing
upon you the other day.

00:20:51.510 --> 00:20:52.340
Not at all.

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:55.780
I appreciate the various trouble
you've gone to for our students.

00:20:56.450 --> 00:20:57.250
And you are?

00:20:58.690 --> 00:20:59.910
I'm Sato Sei.

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:02.210
I see, so you are the one.

00:21:02.590 --> 00:21:03.850
Um, what brings you here today?

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:05.890
I came to see the Academy Director.

00:21:06.060 --> 00:21:08.220
Oh, then I shall show you the way.

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:10.290
That's fine, I know my way.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:13.220
Things haven't changed one bit around here.

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:15.390
Then, good day.

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:19.160
That lady...

00:21:19.470 --> 00:21:21.440
It turns out, she was an alumna of Lillian.

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:25.230
And she said she found out
that Kaori-san was alive, too.

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:30.240
She said she was going to see
Kaori-san on Christmas Eve, but...

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:33.310
Then, does that mean Kaori-san is here?

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:35.320
Oh... maybe.

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:37.610
But she said she was going to
see the Academy Director...

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:40.220
I see! So that's it!

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:41.960
The Academy Director is Kaori-san!

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:43.220
Thank goodness!

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:46.800
Then, they'll be reunited for
the first time in decades!

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:49.700
Rosa Gigantea?

00:21:50.270 --> 00:21:51.400
Come on, let's go.

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:53.040
The party's about to start.

00:21:53.210 --> 00:21:54.200
R-Right.

00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:57.540
Rosa Gigantea?

00:21:57.740 --> 00:21:58.400
What?

00:21:59.280 --> 00:22:00.440
Merry Christmas!

00:22:01.110 --> 00:22:02.240
Do I hear one more?

00:22:02.320 --> 00:22:02.940
Huh?

00:22:03.020 --> 00:22:05.110
Tomorrow's my birthday.

00:22:05.720 --> 00:22:08.150
My happy birthday!

00:23:21.860 --> 00:23:22.500
Preview

00:23:22.500 --> 00:23:23.930
Preview
From the troubling declaration of sisterhood,

00:23:23.930 --> 00:23:25.330
Preview
we have finally come to this point!

00:23:25.330 --> 00:23:26.030
Preview
At last, we will go on our first date, Onee-sama!

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:27.330
At last, we will go on our first date, Onee-sama!

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:30.170
I cannot think that a date with
you will end without mishap.

00:23:30.170 --> 00:23:32.210
I will keep you entertained
to the end, Onee-sama!

00:23:32.210 --> 00:23:32.570
Next Time
I will keep you entertained
to the end, Onee-sama!
